  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in net available oil and refined‑fuel supply reduces crude-price spikes and input‑cost uncertainty, directly calming trading in Brazilian equities, bonds and FX and thus lowering short‑term market volatility.</data>
