  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Greater effectiveness of sanctions increases the risk of secondary sanctions and compliance costs for banks and corporates with Russia‑linked exposures, prompting international investors to de‑risk Brazilian positions and lowering investor confidence.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">brazil_market_turmoil</data>
