  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">More effective sanctions restrict targeted actors' access to finance and counterparties, increasing perceived default and liquidity risk and forcing investors to demand higher risk premia on exposed credits and equities.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_money_markets</data>
</edge>
