  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Escalating kinetic operations raise global risk‑off sentiment, driving accelerated portfolio withdrawals from emerging markets and directly increasing Brazil’s net capital outflow rate.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
