  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden escalation in military pressure triggers flight-to-safety into sovereign bonds and reassessment of near-term growth, causing markets to lower implied probabilities of near-term policy rate hikes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_money_markets</data>
