  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in cross‑border AI capital into public and private Brazilian tech-linked firms boosts trading liquidity and valuation support for those issuers, damping short‑term price swings in equity and currency markets and therefore reducing measured market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
