  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Large swings or surges in capital allocation into AI sectors produce rapid repricing, thinner liquidity in non-AI segments and increased event-driven trading, elevating realised and implied market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_money_markets</data>
