  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden tightening of export controls and trade restrictions on critical inputs (e.g., energy, chemicals, or machinery) reduces FX earnings and FDI pipeline for Brazilian exporters and raises import costs, directly tightening FX supply and increasing downward pressure on the real.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">brazil_market_turmoil</data>
