  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">New or tightened US–China export controls and market-access limits raise expected earnings and supply-chain disruption risk for affected firms, prompting investors to demand higher credit and equity risk premia.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_money_markets</data>
