  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A sharp fall in investor confidence tied to Brazilian market turmoil triggers a global EM risk‑off and portfolio reallocation into/out of commodity futures, producing larger, more frequent swings in oil and gas prices.</data>
