  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Acute volatility in Brazilian asset prices triggers VaR‑based de‑risking and cross‑asset hedging by global funds, transmitting higher realized and implied volatility into broader currency, equity and EM credit markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-3 months</data>
  <data key="d38">brazil_market_turmoil</data>
  <data key="d39">global_money_markets</data>
</edge>
