  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in Brazilian market volatility make governance and accounting issues in foreign-listed or China-linked tech firms with Brazilian operations more visible, prompting US and allied regulators to open investigations and accelerate rule‑making focused on cross‑border AI and data activities.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">brazil_market_turmoil</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
