  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained capital flight from Brazil reduces upstream investment and maintenance in domestic oil projects (including Petrobras-led capacity), lowering Brazilian crude and refined‑fuel output and tightening the contemporaneous global energy supply balance.</data>
