<edge source="global_money_markets::short_term_policy_rate" target="brazil_market_turmoil::exchange_rate_pressure" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A rise in major global short‑term policy rates tightens dollar funding conditions and raises foreign return premia, producing immediate FX derivative squeezes and portfolio rebalancing that put downward pressure on the Brazilian real.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_money_markets</data>
  <data key="d39">brazil_market_turmoil</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_money_markets::short_term_policy_rate" target="iran_regional_escalation::hydrocarbon_supply_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained increases in short‑term policy rates raise dollar funding costs and borrowing spreads for upstream firms and sovereign export finance, delaying investment and maintenance and reducing oil and gas output and exports over time.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_money_markets</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_money_markets::short_term_policy_rate" target="russia_ukraine_war::sanction_effectiveness" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher short-term policy rates tighten global dollar and euro liquidity and raise the cost/availability of correspondent banking and trade finance that Russian corporates and intermediaries rely on, making existing financial restrictions more binding and thus increasing sanctions' practical effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_money_markets</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_money_markets::short_term_policy_rate" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::ai_investment_flow" id="0">
