  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher short-term policy rates raise the cost of debt and increase discount rates, directly reducing venture fundraising, late-stage valuations and corporate capex available for AI projects, lowering AI investment flows.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_money_markets</data>
